  1	<!DOCTYPE html>
  2	<html lang="en">
  3	<head>
  4	<meta charset="UTF-8">
  5	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  6	<title>TMI — Director Conflict of Interest Disclosure</title>
  7	<style>
  8	  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&display=swap');
  9	
 10	  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
 11	
 12	  body {
 13	    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
 14	    font-size: 13pt;
 15	    line-height: 1.75;
 16	    color: #1a1410;
 17	    background: #fff;
 18	  }
 19	
 20	  .page {
 21	    max-width: 8.5in;
 22	    margin: 0 auto;
 23	    padding: 1in 1.1in 1in 1.1in;
 24	    min-height: 11in;
 25	  }
 26	
 27	  .header {
 28	    text-align: center;
 29	    border-bottom: 2px solid #b8912a;
 30	    padding-bottom: 18px;
 31	    margin-bottom: 32px;
 32	  }
 33	
 34	  .org-name {
 35	    font-size: 15pt;
 36	    font-weight: 600;
 37	    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
 38	    color: #1a2a5e;
 39	    text-transform: uppercase;
 40	  }
 41	
 42	  .org-sub {
 43	    font-size: 10pt;
 44	    color: #5a5450;
 45	    margin-top: 4px;
 46	    font-style: italic;
 47	  }
 48	
 49	  .doc-title {
 50	    font-size: 13pt;
 51	    font-weight: 600;
 52	    color: #1a2a5e;
 53	    margin-top: 12px;
 54	    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
 55	  }
 56	
 57	  p { margin-bottom: 14px; text-align: justify; }
 58	
 59	  .section-head {
 60	    font-weight: 600;
 61	    color: #1a2a5e;
 62	    margin-top: 24px;
 63	    margin-bottom: 10px;
 64	    font-size: 11.5pt;
 65	    text-transform: uppercase;
 66	    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
 67	    border-bottom: 1px solid #c8b89a;
 68	    padding-bottom: 4px;
 69	  }
 70	
 71	  .disclosure-item {
 72	    display: flex;
 73	    align-items: flex-start;
 74	    margin-bottom: 20px;
 75	    gap: 14px;
 76	  }
 77	
 78	  .checkbox {
 79	    width: 16px;
 80	    height: 16px;
 81	    border: 1.5px solid #1a1410;
 82	    flex-shrink: 0;
 83	    margin-top: 4px;
 84	  }
 85	
 86	  .disclosure-text {
 87	    flex: 1;
 88	  }
 89	
 90	  .field-row {
 91	    margin-bottom: 20px;
 92	  }
 93	
 94	  .field-label {
 95	    font-size: 10.5pt;
 96	    color: #5a5450;
 97	    text-transform: uppercase;
 98	    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
 99	    margin-bottom: 4px;
100	  }
101	
102	  .field-line {
103	    border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1410;
104	    height: 28px;
105	    width: 100%;
106	  }
107	
108	  .field-line-short {
109	    border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1410;
110	    height: 28px;
111	    width: 60%;
112	    display: inline-block;
113	  }
114	
115	  .sig-area {
116	    margin-top: 40px;
117	    display: flex;
118	    gap: 60px;
119	  }
120	
121	  .sig-col {
122	    flex: 1;
123	  }
124	
125	  .sig-line {
126	    border-top: 1px solid #1a1410;
127	    margin-top: 52px;
128	    margin-bottom: 4px;
129	  }
130	
131	  .sig-label {
132	    font-size: 10pt;
133	    color: #5a5450;
134	  }
135	
136	  .note-box {
137	    border: 1px solid #c8b89a;
138	    background: #faf7f2;
139	    padding: 14px 18px;
140	    margin: 20px 0;
141	    font-size: 11.5pt;
142	    font-style: italic;
143	    color: #5a5450;
144	  }
145	
146	  .footer {
147	    margin-top: 48px;
148	    border-top: 1px solid #c8b89a;
149	    padding-top: 10px;
150	    text-align: center;
151	    font-size: 9.5pt;
152	    color: #5a5450;
153	    font-style: italic;
154	  }
155	
156	  @media print {
157	    .page { padding: 0.85in 1in; }
158	  }
159	</style>
160	</head>
161	<body>
162	<div class="page">
163	
164	  <div class="header">
165	    <div class="org-name">The Thessalonian Mandate Institute</div>
166	    <div class="org-sub">Austin, Texas &nbsp;·&nbsp; 26 U.S.C. § 508(c)(1)(A)</div>
167	    <div class="doc-title">Director Conflict of Interest Disclosure</div>
168	  </div>
169	
170	  <p>
171	    This Disclosure is completed by each incoming Director of The Thessalonian Mandate Institute
172	    prior to appointment, in accordance with Article IV, Section 4.3(d) of the Bylaws. It shall
173	    be retained in the organizational records of the Institute.
174	  </p>
175	
176	  <div class="section-head">Director Information</div>
177	
178	  <div class="field-row">
179	    <div class="field-label">Full Legal Name</div>
180	    <div class="field-line"></div>
181	  </div>
182	
183	  <div class="field-row">
184	    <div class="field-label">Mailing Address</div>
185	    <div class="field-line"></div>
186	  </div>
187	
188	  <div class="field-row">
189	    <div class="field-label">City, State, ZIP</div>
190	    <div class="field-line"></div>
191	  </div>
192	
193	  <div class="field-row">
194	    <div class="field-label">Email Address</div>
195	    <div class="field-line"></div>
196	  </div>
197	
198	  <div class="field-row">
199	    <div class="field-label">Phone Number</div>
200	    <div class="field-line-short"></div>
201	  </div>
202	
203	  <div class="section-head">Conflict of Interest Disclosures</div>
204	
205	  <p>Please review each statement below and check the box to confirm your agreement. If any
206	  statement is not true, do not check the box — instead describe the exception on the lines
207	  provided and discuss with the Founder/Minister before appointment proceeds.</p>
208	
209	  <div class="disclosure-item">
210	    <div class="checkbox"></div>
211	    <div class="disclosure-text">
212	      I have no personal financial relationship with Rickey Jay Bennett II, the Founder and
213	      Minister of The Thessalonian Mandate Institute. I am not a creditor, debtor, business
214	      partner, co-signer, or financial dependent of his, and no financial arrangement exists
215	      between us that would impair my ability to exercise independent judgment on behalf of
216	      the Institute.
217	    </div>
218	  </div>
219	
220	  <div class="disclosure-item">
221	    <div class="checkbox"></div>
222	    <div class="disclosure-text">
223	      I have no financial interest in the assets, revenues, or contracts of The Thessalonian
224	      Mandate Institute beyond the mission of the organization. I will not personally benefit
225	      financially from decisions I make as a Director, except for reimbursement of reasonable
226	      expenses actually incurred in service to the Institute.
227	    </div>
228	  </div>
229	
230	  <div class="disclosure-item">
231	    <div class="checkbox"></div>
232	    <div class="disclosure-text">
233	      I am not currently an employee, contractor, or paid service provider to The Thessalonian
234	      Mandate Institute, and I understand that if I enter into any compensated relationship
235	      with the Institute, that arrangement must be approved by disinterested Directors and
236	      documented in Board minutes.
237	    </div>
238	  </div>
239	
240	  <div class="disclosure-item">
241	    <div class="checkbox"></div>
242	    <div class="disclosure-text">
243	      I commit to promptly disclose to the full Board any potential conflict of interest that
244	      arises during my service, including any financial relationship with the Founder/Minister
245	      or with the Institute that develops after the date of this Disclosure.
246	    </div>
247	  </div>
248	
249	  <div class="section-head">Exceptions or Additional Disclosures</div>
250	
251	  <p>If any of the above statements are not fully accurate, describe the exception here. Leave
252	  blank if no exceptions apply.</p>
253	
254	  <div class="field-line" style="margin-bottom:10px;"></div>
255	  <div class="field-line" style="margin-bottom:10px;"></div>
256	  <div class="field-line"></div>
257	
258	  <div class="note-box">
259	    An undisclosed conflict of interest is grounds for removal from the Board under Article IV,
260	    Section 4.5 of the Bylaws. This Disclosure does not require that a Director have no prior
261	    relationship with the Founder — it requires that any such relationship be disclosed, and
262	    that the Director can still exercise independent judgment on behalf of the organization.
263	  </div>
264	
265	  <div class="section-head">Certification</div>
266	
267	  <p>
268	    I certify that the information provided in this Disclosure is accurate and complete to the
269	    best of my knowledge, and that I understand my ongoing obligation to disclose any future
270	    conflicts of interest to the Board of The Thessalonian Mandate Institute.
271	  </p>
272	
273	  <div class="sig-area">
274	    <div class="sig-col">
275	      <div class="sig-line"></div>
276	      <div class="sig-label">Director Signature</div>
277	    </div>
278	    <div class="sig-col">
279	      <div class="sig-line"></div>
280	      <div class="sig-label">Date</div>
281	    </div>
282	  </div>
283	
284	  <div style="margin-top:28px;">
285	    <div class="field-label">Printed Name</div>
286	    <div class="field-line-short"></div>
287	  </div>
288	
289	  <div class="footer">
290	    The Thessalonian Mandate Institute &nbsp;·&nbsp; Austin, Texas &nbsp;·&nbsp; 26 U.S.C. § 508(c)(1)(A)<br>
291	    Retain in organizational records &nbsp;·&nbsp; "The one who is willing to work shall be equipped to work."
292	  </div>
293	
294	</div>
295	</body>
296	</html>
